STATUS (agent B, nodetp8_fwd) -- FINAL v3. Both layers WORKING, validated, tuned. H100 job 1063 (GPU-4b202516-..., 1980 MHz).

API  scripts/nodetp8_fwd/nodetp_fwd.py
  make_cfg(conv_tp) -> NodeCfg ; fwd(layer_cfg, x, y, w, edge_index, csr, out=None, G=None, PG=None) -> out [N, d_out] fp64
  layer_cfg: NodeCfg | the conv_tp module (cfg cached on it) | dict/object with key/attr conv_tp|node_cfg|b_cfg|module.
  csr: needs perm_dst (int32 or int64) + rowptr_dst [N+1] (int32; int64 converted). Works with C's csr.py (used in tests).
  build_csr local stub (same signature) kept in nodetp_fwd.py. Kernel on current stream, no host syncs, CUDA-graph
  capturable (tested), launch config depends only on (N, E); E=0 and zero in-degree -> zeros (tested). Extension built via
  load_inline under $TORCH_EXTENSIONS_DIR (first build ~40 s per layer, cached by cfg hash).

Design: 1 CTA per dst node, thread u = channel u (uvu channel-diagonal), G edge-slices of 128 threads per CTA (G=1..4,
  chosen from shapes) reduced once in smem; accumulators in registers (L0 16, L1 40 per thread); next-edge operands
  prefetched; CG = o3.wigner_3j fp64 * path_weight baked as %.17g literals (module _w3j buffers == o3 fp64 exactly, checked);
  x_i*y_j products shared across paths; each output written once, no atomics. L0 paths 0e x l -> l reduce to
  C = path_weight/sqrt(2l+1) * delta (= 1 numerically for component norm; derived from the w3j table, verified).
  Path grouping (LunaTP-style, PG=2/4) implemented but measured SLOWER (re-gathers x, more warps of 238-reg L1 code) -> PG=1.

Correctness (vs MACE conv_tp + gather + scatter_sum, fp64): max rel(max|ref|) <= 1.1e-15, max abs <= 6.2e-15 on aspirin,
  org192, water192, org648, water648, wbox648 (both layers); random w/ padded zero-weight self-edges + isolated nodes
  <= 1.0e-15; E=0 exact zeros; near-zero (|ref|<1e-8) entries max abs err <= 4.4e-16. Threshold 1e-12: PASS.

